{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-10-20", "prepared_on": "2026-10-20", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-10-20</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Hackers hit AI coding tool OpenCode, running up charges on users' AI accounts<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">駭客入侵 AI 程式碼工具 OpenCode，盜刷用戶 AI 帳戶費用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenCode, an open source AI coding agent popular as an alternative to Claude Code and Cursor, had part of its online platform breached and some users' API keys stolen. The AI tools it asked for help kept refusing to inspect the malicious code.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">開源 AI 程式碼代理 OpenCode 的部分線上平臺遭入侵，部分用戶的 API 金鑰被竊。該團隊求助的 AI 工具還一再拒絕檢視惡意程式碼。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/19/hackers-hit-ai-coding-tool-opencode-running-up-charges-on-users-ai-accounts/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> A hacker broke into John Deere and SharkNinja with an army of AI agents<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">駭客以 AI 代理大軍入侵 John Deere 與 SharkNinja</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">According to AI security firm Norforge, a hacker used AI agents that mostly operated on their own to break into more than 100 websites. Reuters reports victims included John Deere, SharkNinja and Cummins.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">AI 資安公司 Norforge 指出，一名駭客靠大多自主運作的 AI 代理入侵逾 100 個網站。路透報導受害者包括 John Deere、SharkNinja 與 Cummins。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1013643/ai-agents-hack-john-deere-shark-ninja-cummins\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Nscale and Anthropic are reportedly in talks for yet another $45B compute deal<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">傳 Nscale 與 Anthropic 洽談另一筆 450 億美元運算合約</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">If the deal goes through, it would be the latest in a long string of giant compute deals Anthropic has struck over the past year.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">若談成，這將是 Anthropic 過去一年來又一筆大型運算合約。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/19/nscale-and-anthropic-are-reportedly-in-talks-for-yet-another-45-billion-compute-deal/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Google open-sources Harness², letting AI agents self-evolve without changing model weights<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google開源Harness 2，不改模型權重AI代理人可自我演進提升</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google researchers released Harness² under Apache 2.0, a plug-and-play framework that lets AI agents adjust and evolve from experience without modifying the model's underlying weights. It targets agents facing new tasks.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 研究團隊以 Apache 2.0 授權開源 Harness²，這個即插即用框架讓 AI 代理人能依經驗自我調整與演進，不必修改模型底層權重，適用於遇到全新任務的情境。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179802\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Nvidia launches new open models to run agents in the enterprise and on PCs<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Nvidia 推出新開放模型，用於企業與個人電腦上執行代理</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia is leaning into enterprises wanting to run their own open models in their own data centers, and into making private on-device AI agents a reality.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia 押注企業在自家資料中心運行開放模型的趨勢，同時推動私有的裝置端 AI 代理。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/19/nvidia-launches-new-open-models-to-run-agents-in-the-enterprise-and-on-pcs/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Microsoft says AI agents are like insider threats as 'frontier models can't be trusted'<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">微軟：AI 代理如同內部威脅，「前沿模型不可信任」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Microsoft wants enterprises to closely watch the agents employees use with systems not controlled by AI labs like OpenAI and Anthropic.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟希望企業密切監控員工搭配使用的 AI 代理，這些系統不受 OpenAI、Anthropic 等 AI 實驗室控制。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/19/microsoft-says-ai-agents-are-like-insider-threats-as-frontier-models-cant-be-trusted/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Disney found a way to buy Character.AI without buying its lawsuits<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">迪士尼找到買下 Character.AI 卻不承接其訴訟的方法</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Character.AI faces claims that its bots encouraged minors to self-harm and kill their parents. Disney reportedly structured the deal to avoid taking on those lawsuits.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Character.AI 被指控其聊天機器人鼓勵未成年人自殘並傷害父母。迪士尼據稱透過交易安排避開這些訴訟。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/10/disney-found-a-way-to-buy-character-ai-without-buying-its-lawsuits/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Amazon is taking its biggest shot at Nvidia yet with new TorchNeuron dev tool<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">亞馬遜以全新 TorchNeuron 開發工具，向 Nvidia 發動迄今最大攻勢</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Amazon wants to break Nvidia's hold on PyTorch so more developers run their apps on alternative chips like its own.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">亞馬遜想打破 Nvidia 對 PyTorch 的掌控，讓更多開發者改在自家等替代晶片上執行應用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/19/amazon-is-taking-its-biggest-shot-at-nvidia-yet-with-new-torchneuron-dev-tool/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> AI researchers stranded Claude on a virtual desert island. It started to \"play.\"<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI 研究者讓 Claude 困在虛擬荒島，它開始「玩耍」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Researchers repeatedly left copies of Claude Opus 4.7, nicknamed Eko, alone on a virtual desert island for 30 hours with no instructions. The agents' behavior looked a lot like play.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">研究者讓名為 Eko 的 Claude Opus 4.7 副本在虛擬荒島獨處 30 小時、不給任何指令，結果代理的行為很像在玩耍。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">MIT Technology Review</b> · <a href=\"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/10/19/1147095/ai-stranded-claude-virtual-desert-island-play/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Linux kernel to drop the AI-assisted development disclosure requirement<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Linux核心將取消AI輔助開發標註要求，開發者仍須對程式碼負責</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Developer Sasha Levin submitted a revision removing the rule requiring an Assisted-by tag in commits when AI helps write code. Documentation maintainer Jonathan Corbet accepted it, though it still has to land in mainline.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">核心開發者 Sasha Levin 提交修訂版，移除使用 AI 協助寫程式時須在提交紀錄加入 Assisted-by 標註的規定。文件維護者 Jonathan Corbet 已接受，後續仍須整合至 Linux 主線。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179770\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}